    "detailed_description": "<i>Explore</i> a world of <strong>pixel art</strong> fantasy, where every building holds a <i>unique surprise</i>. <i>Help</i> the locals, <i>dance</i> in a side quest, and finish the main quest. But don't forget, it's your birthday at the end of the day!<br>Have <strong>FUN</strong>!<br><br><strong>Lore-heavy: </strong><br>The game focuses on the lore of Cotton Kingdom and does not contain much intense battle mechanics.<br><br><strong>Male-centric: </strong><br>The game was originally developed to wish the developer's brother on his birthday, so it is male-centric and does not have a gender-change feature.<br><br><strong>Short and sweet:</strong><br>The game can be completed in 45-60 minutes and there is no post-game content.<br><br><strong>Free to play:</strong><br>The game does not require any permissions or in-app purchases. It is completely free to play for life.<br><br><strong>Controls:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Click &quot;Options&quot; from the Title Screen to configure Keyboard mappings<br></li><li>Use mouse pointer as a secondary control</li></ul><br><strong>Made with RPG Maker MV:</strong><br>The game was created using the RPG Maker MV game engine. All credits and references are published at the end of the game as rolling credits.",
